# Health session architecture rules

Read `docs/architecture/HEALTH_SESSION_ARCHITECTURE.md` before changing health session code.

## Agent stack

- Consumer health agent = `kelly-pa-video-orchestrator.js` (Groq tool loop).
- Do **not** wire `kelly-rails`, `video-consult-graph`, or Pinecone coding RAG into `health-*` rooms.
- Derm answers use `RAG_EDUCATION_URL` via `video-tool-registry` → `run_derm_patient_qa` only.

## File size limits

- Keep new modules under ~400 lines. Split before growing monoliths.
- Do **not** add health logic to `server.js`, `database.js`, or `retell-websocket.js` — use dedicated services/routes.

## UI surfaces

- Consumer: `unified-dashboard/health-video.html` + `assets/js/health-video/`.
- Provider HUD `business/video-call.html` is **frozen** — extract patterns only, do not merge.

## Session changes

When altering session flow, DB schema, or auth — update `HEALTH_SESSION_ARCHITECTURE.md` in the same PR.

